--- !u!114 &8424219675579236305
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6509828338015491337}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d3cb01aa01cc5504ab1abf584cad3aec, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueCanvas: {fileID: 614375750417813178}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 2596970861217695629}
  responseButton: {fileID: 4052697755306884244}
  responseButtonText: {fileID: 7392475554381698565}
  interactPrompt: {fileID: 2024993707772431546}
  npcDialogueLines:
  - "ELDER THEROS: Ah... you awaken at last. I feared Erebus\u2019s darkness had
    claimed you, as it has so many others. But no\u2014there is still hope. "
  - 'ELDER THEROS: Listen closely, for time works against us. '
  - "ELDER THEROS: This world was once ruled in harmony by the four Elemental Guardians\u2014Hephaestus
    of Flame, Gaia of Stone, Poseidon of the Depths, and Vayu of the Sky. Their balance
    kept our lands prosperous and whole. "
  - 'ELDER THEROS: But Erebus, the shadow-born ruler of darkness, sought dominion
    over all. In his greed, he cast a terrible curse, sealing the Guardians in slumber
    and scattering their sacred totems across the realms. '
  - "ELDER THEROS: Now the world unravels\u2014storms rage, lands wither, oceans
    rise, and even the air refuses to sing. The balance is broken."
  - 'ELDER THEROS: You, traveler, are our final hope. You must journey into each
    elemental realm, face its trials, and reclaim the totems. Only by restoring all
    four can you confront Erebus and shatter his curse. '
  - 'ELDER THEROS: Your path will be harsh. Each realm will test your strength, your
    wisdom, your very soul. But you will not face this alone. The elemental powers
    will awaken within you, if you prove yourself worthy. Learn their ways, and they
    will guide you. '
  - "ELDER THEROS: Now go. Begin with the earth\u2014where roots still remember,
    and stone still holds the memory of balance. Gaia waits for you... though she
    may not recognize friend from foe. "
  playerResponsePrompts:
  - 'Darkness? Where am I? Who are you? '
  - "I\u2019m listening. Tell me what I need to do. "
  - "Guardians... I\u2019ve heard whispers in dreams. They\u2019re real, then? "
  - "So that\u2019s why everything feels... broken. Twisted. "
  - "Then I\u2019ll fix it. I have to. "
  - "I\u2019ll do whatever it takes. Tell me where to start. "
  - "I\u2019ll master them all\u2014earth, water, air, and fire. Erebus won\u2019t
    stop me. "
  - "Let her test me. I\u2019ll earn her trust\u2014and her power. "
